---
layout: base.njk
title: Contact
description: "Get in touch with John French — Product Design Director. Available for full-time roles and select consulting engagements."
---

<section class="contact-page">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="contact-page__inner">

      <div class="contact-info">
        <p class="page-hero__eyebrow animate-up delay-1">Contact</p>
        <h1 class="animate-up delay-2">
          Let's make<br/><em>something</em><br/>good.
        </h1>
        <p class="animate-up delay-3">
          I'm currently open to Product Design Director roles and select consulting engagements.
          If you have a design challenge that needs an experienced hand, I'd love to hear about it.
        </p>

        <div class="contact-links animate-up delay-4">
          <a href="mailto:hello@johnfrench.xyz" class="contact-link">
            <span class="contact-link__label">Email</span>
            <span class="contact-link__value">hello@johnfrench.xyz</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/john-french-6022bb12" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="contact-link">
            <span class="contact-link__label">LinkedIn</span>
            <span class="contact-link__value">linkedin.com/in/john-french-6022bb12 ↗</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/John-French-Product-Design-and-UX-Lead.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="contact-link">
            <span class="contact-link__label">Résumé</span>
            <span class="contact-link__value">Download PDF ↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-form animate-up delay-3">
        <form name="contact" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field">
          <!-- Netlify form detection -->
          <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact" />
          <p class="visually-hidden">
            <label>Don't fill this out: <input name="bot-field" /></label>
          </p>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label class="form-label" for="name">Name</label>
            <input class="form-input" type="text" id="name" name="name" required autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your name" />
          </div>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label class="form-label" for="email">Email</label>
            <input class="form-input" type="email" id="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" placeholder="your@email.com" />
          </div>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label class="form-label" for="subject">Subject</label>
            <input class="form-input" type="text" id="subject" name="subject" placeholder="What's this about?" />
          </div>

          <div class="form-group">
            <label class="form-label" for="message">Message</label>
            <textarea class="form-textarea" id="message" name="message" required placeholder="Tell me about your project or opportunity…"></textarea>
          </div>

          <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary" style="width:100%;">Send Message</button>
        </form>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
